{"id":"1ec557e9594de2d8","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-schnorr-total-solovay.md","title":"Schnorr 随机性的总 Solovay 刻画","display":"thm-schnorr-total-solovay — Schnorr 随机性的总 Solovay 刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-schnorr-total-solovay","aliases":["43-thm-schnorr-total-solovay"],"display":"thm-schnorr-total-solovay — Schnorr 随机性的总 Solovay 刻画","depends_on":["[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]","[[43-df-total-solovaytest]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.3.1 Theorem 10.3.5，印刷216，PDF236","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-schnorr-total-solovay"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-schnorr-total-solovay</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-schnorr-total-solovay — Schnorr 随机性的总 Solovay 刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"82047d3b859c7b80\" href=\"?note=82047d3b859c7b80\" title=\"43-df-total-solovaytest\">43-df-total-solovaytest</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.3.1 Theorem 10.3.5，印刷216，PDF236"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；Schnorr随机性与总Solovay检验见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"82047d3b859c7b80\" href=\"?note=82047d3b859c7b80\" title=\"43-df-total-solovaytest\">43-df-total-solovaytest</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalSolovayTest}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalSolovayTest}\\)</span> 是序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(S\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"82047d3b859c7b80\" href=\"?note=82047d3b859c7b80\" title=\"43-df-total-solovaytest\">43-df-total-solovaytest</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall S\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{TotalSolovayTest}(S)\\Rightarrow\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\ge N\\Rightarrow X\\notin S_n)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall S\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{TotalSolovayTest}(S)\\Rightarrow\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\ge N\\Rightarrow X\\notin S_n)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>总测度可计算使尾部有有效控制，可将无限命中转为Schnorr检验；对一般有限和只能得到ML刻画。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.3.1 Theorem 10.3.5，印刷216，PDF236。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-total-solovaytest","status":"resolved","id":"82047d3b859c7b80","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-total-solovaytest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；Schnorr随机性与总Solovay检验见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]、[[43-df-total-solovaytest]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-total-solovaytest","status":"resolved","id":"82047d3b859c7b80","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；Schnorr随机性与总Solovay检验见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]、[[43-df-total-solovaytest]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrrandom","status":"resolved","id":"c8d43a74ea8721f3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]。\n$\\mathrm{TotalSolovayTest}$ 是序列 $S\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-total-solovaytest]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-total-solovaytest","status":"resolved","id":"82047d3b859c7b80","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]。\n$\\mathrm{TotalSolovayTest}$ 是序列 $S\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-total-solovaytest]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalSolovayTest}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall S\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{TotalSolovayTest}(S)\\Rightarrow\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\ge N\\Rightarrow X\\notin S_n)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1479,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-238","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-schnorr-total-solovay]] — Schnorr 随机性的总 Solovay 刻画"},{"id":"d047c260971950e0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["c8d43a74ea8721f3","82047d3b859c7b80"]}